  "title": "Half-Hour Pudding Cake (Montreal Pudding)",
  "description": "My mom used to make this miracle pudding, and I still make this pudding-like cake. The batter rises to the top during baking, and a pudding-like sauce forms underneath the crust. There is also a lemon version.",
  "authors": [
    "Holly Liddiard"
